 * distance between lines of text. On block-level elements in horizontal writing modes, it specifies
 * the preferred height of line boxes within the element, and on
 * non-[replaced](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Replaced_elements) inline
 * elements, it specifies the height that is used to calculate line box height.
 *
 * Initial: normal. Inherited: yes.
 * Percentages: refer to the font size of the element itself.
 *
 * Keyword effects:
 * - normal: Depends on the user agent. Desktop browsers (including Firefox) use a default value of
 * roughly `1.2`, depending on the element's `font-family`.
 *
